#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/interfaces.md:8 e32521a281774e3ea5d0133b50eaaa69
msgid "Interface contract"
msgstr "Contrato de interfaz"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/interfaces.md:10 a275f50b20854f5690dee3ef4c41e1d6
msgid ""
"Inputs must be explicit, outputs must be inspectable, errors must be "
"returned as errors, and consequential external actions require human "
"approval."
msgstr ""
"Las entradas deben ser explicitas, las salidas inspeccionables, los errores "
"devueltos como errores y las acciones externas importantes requieren "
"aprobacion humana."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/interfaces.md:12 3213a5df29cf46f29435879b73893932
msgid "Compatibility"
msgstr "Compatibilidad"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnp-qnn/interfaces.md:14 f245ea04082f436996a10887e03589f6
msgid ""
"Treat undocumented endpoints, commands, and browser controls as unsupported."
" Confirm the current repository version before integrating another system."
msgstr ""
"Considere no compatibles los endpoints, comandos y controles del navegador "
"no documentados. Confirme la version actual del repositorio antes de "
"integrar otro sistema."
